<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EZR" style="id">- Bible en mashi du Congo</book>
  <para style="toc3">Ezr</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ezra</para>
  <para style="toc1">EZRA</para>
  <para style="h">Ezra</para>
  <para style="mt1">EZRA</para>
  <para style="imt1">Enshokolezi</para>
  <para style="ip">Amango gw’omwâmi Artazerzesi w’e Persi, Ezra ahika e Yeruzalemu haguma n’engabo y’Abayahudi. Ezra ali burhanzi mwandisi wa mwâmi. Ago mango acîlibuza erhi mmanja z’Abayahudi zirhuma. Mwâmi amuhà amaruba mpu aluse abantu b’e Yeruzalemu: ago maruba gahà Ezra olukengwa lw’okuhira irhegeko lya Mûsa omu mulala gw’Abuyahudi. Eyo munda e Yeruzalemu arhimâna Buyahudi banji bafundisire isakramenta ly’Obuhya n’abakazi barhali bw’omu bûko bw’Abayahudi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EZR 7-10">Ezr 7—10</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ezra abà îshe wa «Abayahudi», Olubaga lw’Abayahudi lwahâbirwe oku bushiru bwâge ebi bimanyîso bisharhu byâgo byâgo:</para>
  <para style="ip">1. Abayahudi barhengaga e Babeli lubà «lubaga lwîshogwa».</para>
  <para style="ip">2. Aka-Nyamuzinda k’e Yeruzalemu gwo murhima gw’idini ly’olwo lubaga.</para>
  <para style="ip">3. Okushimba irhegeko co cisiki c’okubà n’akalamo kanene kw’olwo lubaga.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ezra ali erhi alibuzibwe bwenêne n’okuyumanyanya olwo lubaga luhyâhya. Akolêsa obukali n’okuhana abantu barhashimbaga irhegeko bwinjà. Nk’arhali mukali, Abayahudi barhengaga e Babeli bali bacîgusha haguma n’abantu b’agandi mashanja. Ntyo ishanja ly’Abayahudi lyàli lyabà lisungunu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EZR 9-10">Ezr 9—10</ref></char>). Ezra ali mukulu w’abayandikaga okuyankirirwa kw’Abayahudi. ebirimwo ebi:</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Okuyagaluka kw’Abayahudi barhanzi: cigabi <char style="ior"><ref loc="EZR 1:1-2:70">1, 1—2, 70</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Okuyûbaka buhyâhya aka-Nyamuzinda: cigabi <char style="ior"><ref loc="EZR 3:1-6:22">3, 1—6, 22</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Obujà-bugo bwa Ezra: cigabi <char style="ior"><ref loc="EZR 7:1-8:36">7, 1—8, 36</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. Okuyimânika ishanja ly’Abayahudi lyajiragwa na Ezra: cigabi <char style="ior"><ref loc="EZR 9:1-10:44">9, 1—10, 44</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EZR 1"/>
  <para style="ms1">I. Okurhenga elubungo n’okushubiyûbaka buhyâhya aka-Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="s1">Okuyagaluka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 1:1"/>Omu mwâka murhanzi kurhenga Sirusi ali mwâmi e Persi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sirusi ayîma e Persi kurhenga omu mwâka gwa 538 embere Mwâmi Yezu aburhwe.</char></note>, lyo oluderho Nyamubâho aderhereraga omu kanwa k’omulêbi Yeremiya luyunjula, Nyamubâho ahira obugeremwa omu murhima gwa Sirusi mwâmi w’e Persi, anacirhuma entumwa y’akanwa n’ey’amaruba omu cihugo câge coshi, erhi: <verse eid="EZR 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 1:2"/>«Sirusi mwâmi w’e Persi kwo adesire ntya: Nyamubâho Nyamuzinda ôbà omu mpingu ampîre amâmi goshi ga hano igulu, anantegesire okumuyûbakira enyumpa aha Yeruzalemu, omu Buyahudi. <verse eid="EZR 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 1:3"/>“Ngasi muli mwe oli muntu w’olubaga lwâge, Nyamuzinda wâge amulange, akanye ajè e Yeruzalemu omu Buyahudi agend’iyûbaka enyumpa ya Nyamubâho, Nyamuzinda w’Israheli”. <verse eid="EZR 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 1:4"/>“Abanasigire boshi omu bantu b’e Buyahudi, omu ngasi cihugo banalimwo coshi, eyo munda banarhabâle n’ensaranga n’amasholo n’ebirugu; bahêke obusò na ngasi bindi banabwîne bankahash’ibahà, bagend’iyûbakamwo enyumpa ya Nyamubâho e Yeruzalemu”».<verse eid="EZR 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 1:5"/>Abakulu b’omulala gwa Yûda, ogwa Benyamini, abadâhwa n’Abaleviti, ngasi abà Nyamuzinda anahizire muli obwo bugeremwa bwâge, banayîmuka bagend’iyûbaka aka-Nyamuzinda e Yeruzalemu. <verse eid="EZR 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 1:6"/>N’abalungu bâbo boshi bakaz’ibarhabâla n’ebirugu by’amasholo, amarhale n’ebindi birugu; bahirakwo ebirhungwa buzira kuganja orhundi rhulugu rhwa ntya ntya bakazâg’ibahà.<verse eid="EZR 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 1:7"/>Mwâmi Sirusi anacirhôla birya birugu mwâmi Nabukondonozori anyagaga e Yeruzalemu kandi na okubihira omu nyumpa y’omuzimu wâge. <verse eid="EZR 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 1:8"/>Sirusi, mwâmi w’e Persi, anaciyanka birya birugu byoshi, anacibifumbasa Mitredati ye wali mulanzi w’embîko, naye abigoshôla, byajà emwa Sebasari, ye murhwâli wali oyîmire omu Yeruzalemu e Buyahudi. <verse eid="EZR 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 1:9"/>Alaga omubalè gw’ebyo birugu: rhubêhe makumi asharhu rhwa masholo, rhubêhe cihumbi rhwa marhale, rhwere makumi abirhi na mwenda; <verse eid="EZR 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 1:10"/>rhubêhe makumi asharhu rhwa masholo, na rhundi rhubêhe magana anni n’ikumi rhwa marhale, rhwaligi rhwa kabirhi n’ebindi birugu cihumbi. <verse eid="EZR 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 1:11"/>Byoshi haguma ebirugu by’amasholo n’eby’amarhale byàli bihumbi birhanu na magana anni. Sebasari agalukana byoshi erhi balya bâli bahêsirwe bujà e Babiloni bashubira e Yeruzalemu.<verse eid="EZR 1:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EZR 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Olukere lw’abayagalukaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 2:1"/>Alaga engabo y’abantu bahêkagwa bujà na mwâmi Nabukondonozori mwâmi w’e Babeli, amango bagwârhagwa mpira, kandi bashub’iyagaluka, bashubira e Yeruzalemu omu Buyahudi, ngasi muguma omu cishagala câge. <verse eid="EZR 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 2:2"/>Baligi abarhengaga yo na Zorobabeli, Yozwè, Nehemiya, Seraya, Rehelaya, Nahamani, Mordokayi, Bilshani, Mispar, Bigwayi, Rehumu, Bânâ: omuganjo gw’olwo lubaga lwa bene Israheli: <verse eid="EZR 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 2:3"/>Bene Parosi, bihumbi bibirhi n’igana na makumi gali nda. <verse eid="EZR 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 2:4"/>Bene Shefatya, magana asharhu na makumi gali nda na babirhi. <verse eid="EZR 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 2:5"/>Bene Ara magana gali nda na makumi gali nda na barhanu. <verse eid="EZR 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 2:6"/>Bene Pahat-Mowabu, bo bene Yozwè na bene Yowabu, bihumbi bibirhi na magana gali munâni na ikumi na babirhi. <verse eid="EZR 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 2:7"/>Bene Elamu, cihumbi na magana abirhi na makumi arhanu na bâni. <verse eid="EZR 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 2:8"/>Bene Zatu, magana galimwenda na makumi anni na barhanu. <verse eid="EZR 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 2:9"/>Bene Zakayi magana gali nda na makumi gali ndarhu. <verse eid="EZR 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 2:10"/>Bene Bâni, magana gali ndarhu na makumi anni na babirhi. <verse eid="EZR 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 2:11"/>Bene Bebayi, magana gali ndarhu na makumi abiri na basharhu. <verse eid="EZR 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 2:12"/>Bene Azgadi, cihumbi na magana abirhi na makumi abirhi na babirhi. <verse eid="EZR 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 2:13"/>Bene Adonikamu, magana gali ndarhu, makumi gali ndarhu na ndarhu, <verse eid="EZR 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 2:14"/>Bene Bigwayi: bihumbi bibirhi na makumi arhanu na ndarhu. <verse eid="EZR 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 2:15"/>Bene Adini, magana anni na makumi arhanu na bâni. <verse eid="EZR 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 2:16"/>Bene Ateri, w’omu mulala gwa Hezekiyahu, makumi gali mwenda na munâni. <verse eid="EZR 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 2:17"/>Bene Bezayi; magana asharhu na makumi abirhi na basharhu. <verse eid="EZR 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 2:18"/>Bene Yora, igana na ikumi na babirhi. <verse eid="EZR 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 2:19"/>Bene Hashum, magana abirhi na makumi abirhi na basharhu. <verse eid="EZR 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 2:20"/>Bene Gibari, makumi gali mwenda na barhanu. <verse eid="EZR 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 2:21"/>Bene Betelehemu, igana na makumi abirhi na basharhu. <verse eid="EZR 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 2:22"/>Bene Netofa, makumi arhanu na ndarhu. <verse eid="EZR 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 2:23"/>Bene Anatoti, igana na makumi abirhi na munâni. <verse eid="EZR 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 2:24"/>Bene Azimaweti, makumi anni na babirhi. <verse eid="EZR 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 2:25"/>Bene Kiryati-Yearimi na Kefira na Beroti, magana gali nda na makumi anni na basharhu. <verse eid="EZR 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 2:26"/>Bene Rama na Geba, magana gali ndarhu na makumi abirhi na muguma. <verse eid="EZR 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 2:27"/>Bene Mikimasi, igana na makumi abirhi na babirhi. <verse eid="EZR 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 2:28"/>Bene Beteli na Ayi, magana abirhi na makumi abirhi na basharhu. <verse eid="EZR 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 2:29"/>Bene Nebo, makumi arhanu na babirhi. <verse eid="EZR 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 2:30"/>Bene Magbishi, igana na makumi arhanu na ndarhu. <verse eid="EZR 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 2:31"/>Bene owundi Elamu, cihumbi na magana abirhi na makumi arhanu na bâni. <verse eid="EZR 2:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 2:32"/>Bene Harimu, magana asharhu na makumi abirhi. <verse eid="EZR 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 2:33"/>Bene Lodi na Hadidi na Ono, magana gali nda na makumi abirhi na barhanu. <verse eid="EZR 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 2:34"/>Bene Yeriko, magana asharhu na makumi anni na barhanu. <verse eid="EZR 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 2:35"/>Bene Sena, bihumbi bisharhu na magana gali ndarhu na makumi asharhu.<verse eid="EZR 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 2:36"/>Abadâhwa: Bene Yedaya w’omu bûko bwa Yozwè, magana gali mwenda na makumi gali nda na basharhu. <verse eid="EZR 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 2:37"/>Bene Imeri, cihumbi na makumi arhanu na babirhi. <verse eid="EZR 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 2:38"/>Bene Pashehuri, cihumbi na magana abirhi na makumi anni na nda. <verse eid="EZR 2:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 2:39"/>Bene Harimu, cihumbi n’ikumi na nda.<verse eid="EZR 2:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 2:40"/>Abaleviti: Bene Yozwè na bene Kadmieli na Hodayiwa, makumi gali nda na bâni. <verse eid="EZR 2:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 2:41"/>Abimbiza: Bene Asafi, igana na makumi abirhi na munâni. <verse eid="EZR 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 2:42"/>Abalanga enyumvi: Bene Shalumu, bene Ateri, bene Talmoni, bene Akubu, bene Hatita, bene Shobayi, boshi haguma, igana na makumi asharhu na mwenda.<verse eid="EZR 2:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 2:43"/>Abanatineni: Bene Siha, bene Hasufa, bene Tabaoti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abo bali bantu bagoshôlagwa na mwâmi Daudi n’abarhambo mpu bagend’ikakolera bene Levi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EZR 8:20">Ezr 8, 20</ref></char>). Abo bantu bali b’omu bûko bwa banyamahanga (ciru amazîno gâbo gône gabahanyire). bakâg’irhabâla oku mikolo misungunu misungunu omu ka-Nyamuzinda (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 44:7-9">Eze 44, 7-9</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 9:23-27">Yoz 9, 23-27</ref></char>).</char></note>, <verse eid="EZR 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 2:44"/>bene Kerosi, bene Siyaha, bene Padoni, <verse eid="EZR 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZR 2:45"/>bene Lebana, bene Hagaba, bene Akubu, <verse eid="EZR 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZR 2:46"/>bene Hagabu, bene Shalmayi, bene Hanani, <verse eid="EZR 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZR 2:47"/>bene Gideli, bene Gahari, bene Reaya, <verse eid="EZR 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZR 2:48"/>bene Resini, bene Nekoda, bene Gazamu, <verse eid="EZR 2:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZR 2:49"/>bene Uza, bene Paseya, bene Besaya, <verse eid="EZR 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="EZR 2:50"/>bene Asena, bene Meuni, bene Nefushisim, <verse eid="EZR 2:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EZR 2:51"/>bene Bakbuku, bene Hakufa, bene Haruru. <verse eid="EZR 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="EZR 2:52"/>Bene Basluti, bene Mehida, bene Harsha, <verse eid="EZR 2:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="EZR 2:53"/>Bene Barkosi, bene Sisera, bene Tema, <verse eid="EZR 2:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="EZR 2:54"/>bene Nesiya na bene Hatifa.<verse eid="EZR 2:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="EZR 2:55"/>Abâna b’abajà ba Salomoni: Bene Sotayi, bene Sofereti, bene Peruda, <verse eid="EZR 2:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="EZR 2:56"/>bene Yaala, bene Darkoni, bene Gideli, <verse eid="EZR 2:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="EZR 2:57"/>bene Shefatya, bene Hatili, bene Pokereti-Hasebayimi, bene Ami. <verse eid="EZR 2:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="EZR 2:58"/>Abanatineni na bene abajà ba Salomoni haguma bahika omu magana asharhu na makumi gali mwenda na babirhi.<verse eid="EZR 2:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="EZR 2:59"/>Abarhengaga e Tel-Mela, Tel-Harsha, Kerubu, Adani na Imeri barhahashag’iderha emilala yâbo n’obûko bwâbo lyo bamanyîsa oku bali bene Israheli. <verse eid="EZR 2:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="EZR 2:60"/>Bene Delaya, bene Tobiya, bene Nekoda: Magana gali ndarhu na makumi arhanu na babirhi; <verse eid="EZR 2:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="EZR 2:61"/>n’omu bene Abadâhwa: bene Habaya, bene Hakosi, bene Barzitat owayankaga mwâli wa Barzilayi, Omugalediti, lêro ayîrikwa izîno lyâge. <verse eid="EZR 2:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="EZR 2:62"/>Balonza ebitabu by’obûko bwâbo barhanabubonagamo; bakulwa omu badâhwa. <verse eid="EZR 2:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="EZR 2:63"/>N’omurhambo abahanza okulya oku biryo bitagatîfu bwenêne, kuhika habè omudâhwa wankadôsa Nyamubâho omu kukolêsa Urimu na Tumimi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 63 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ecihanzo c’okulya oku biryo bitagatîfu: rhulole omu <char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 22:10-16">Lev 22, 10-16</ref></char>; Urimu na Tumimi: byàli birugu abadâhwa bakâg’ikolêsa mîra kurhenga mwâmi Daudi nka balonza okumanya obulonza bwa Nyamuzinda (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 14:41">1 Sam 14, 41</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 16:33">Mig 16, 33</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 28:30">Lub 28, 30</ref></char>)</char></note>.<verse eid="EZR 2:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="EZR 2:64"/>Olubaga loshi lwahika omu bantu bihumbi makumi anni na bibirhi na magana asharhu na makumi gali ndarhu, <verse eid="EZR 2:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="EZR 2:65"/>buzira kuganja bambali na bambali-kazi bâbo abâli bahisire omu bihumbi nda na magana asharhu na makumi asharhu na nda; mulibo mwàli bîmbiza magana abirhi, abalume n’abakazi. <verse eid="EZR 2:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="EZR 2:66"/>Bali bagwêrhe nfarasi magana gali nda na makumi asharhu na ndarhu, ndogomi magana abirhi na makumi anni na irhanu; <verse eid="EZR 2:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="EZR 2:67"/>ngamiya magana anni na makumi asharhu na irhanu na bihumbi ndarhu na magana gali nda na makumi abirhi ga bindi bihêsi.<verse eid="EZR 2:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="EZR 2:68"/>Banji omu bakulu b’emilala, erhi bahika aha ka-Nyamuzinda e Yeruzalemu, barherekêra enterekêro, banalonza ako ka-Nyamuzinda mpu kashub’ishakûlulwa aha kanali. <verse eid="EZR 2:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="EZR 2:69"/>Bahâna ebindi omu mbîko y’omukolo nk’oku banahashire: drakima z’amasholo bihumbi makumi gali ndarhu na ciguma, bihumbi birhanu bya marhale, na bishûli igana bya badâhwa. <verse eid="EZR 2:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="EZR 2:70"/>Abadâhwa n’Abaleviti na baguma omu lubaga babêra aha Yeruzalemu; abimbiza, abalanzi n’abà-Natineni bajà omu bishagala byâbo; n’abandi bene Israheli boshi bajà omu bishagala byâbo.<verse eid="EZR 2:70"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EZR 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Okushubirhangira enterekêro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 3:1"/>Erhi omwêzi gwa kali nda gubà gwamayîsha, n’erhi bene Israheli babà bakola bali omu lugo, olubaga loshi nka muntu muguma lwanacishûbûzanya aha Yeruzalemu. <verse eid="EZR 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 3:2"/>Yozwè nwene Yosadaki na bene wâbo b’abadâhwa na Zorobabeli mwene Shealtieli na bene wâbo, barhondêra okuyûbaka oluhêrero lwa Nyamuzinda w’Israheli mpu bajirireko enterekêro nk’oku biyandisirwe omu Marhegeko ga Mûsa, muntu wa Nnâmahanga. <verse eid="EZR 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 3:3"/>Bayûbakira oluhêrero oku makondo galo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oluhêrero lwayûbakirwa oku makondo gâlwo, bulya eciriba c’oluhêrero lwa mîra cal’imanyikîne kuli boshi: ciru n’amango g’olubungo, Abayahudi babêraga e Yeruzalemu bagendekera okukaz’iyîsh’iharâmya Nyamuzinda omu ciriba c’oluhêrero lwa mîra (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 41:5">Yer 41, 5</ref></char>). Amashanja gali omu cihugo: bâli Buyahudi na ngasi bandi bal’ibezire omu Israheli-Palestina amango g’olubungo. Balimwo Abasamariya, Abamowabu, Abaamoni. Abo boshi barhayumvanyagya na bene Israheli barhengaga elubungo e Babiloni (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EZR 9:1-2">Ezr 9, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 10:2">10, 2</ref>.<ref loc="EZR 10:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:30">Neh 9, 30</ref></char>).</char></note> bulya bâli omu bwôba bw’amashanja gali omu cihugo; banacihêra Nyamubâho enterekêro z’embâgwa sêzi na bijingo. <verse eid="EZR 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 3:4"/>Banacikuza olusiku lukulu lw’amahêma, nk’oku binayandisirwe; banakarherekêra ngasi lusiku nk’oku binayandisirwe oku nterekêro ya ngasi lusiku. <verse eid="EZR 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 3:5"/>Enyuma ly’aho banacirherekêra enterekêro ya ngasi lusiku, bahirako enterekêro za Sabato n’ez’okubaluka kw’omwêzi n’eza ngasi nsiku nkulu zinayêrekîre Nyakasane na abalonzize bakaz’ihêra enterekêro banalonzize. <verse eid="EZR 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 3:6"/>Oku lusiku lurhangiriza lw’omwêzi gwa kali nda, banarhangira okuhêra Nyamubâho enterekêro zâbo ci eciriba ca aka-Nyamuzinda cirhali cicibandwa. <verse eid="EZR 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 3:7"/>Banacihâna ensaranga emw’abashongola amabuye n’ababinji b’empaho. Banacihana ebiryo n’amamvu n’amavurha oku Banyasidoni n'Abanyatiri mpu babarhumire emirhi y’ecidra y’e Libano omu kubigereza oku nyanja kuhika e Yafà, nk’oku mwâmi Sirusi w'Abapersi anali amâyêmêra. <verse eid="EZR 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 3:8"/>Omu mwâka gwa kabirhi kurhenga banahisire aha nyumpa ya Nyamuzinda aha Yeruzalemu omu mwêzi gwa kabirhi, Zorobabeli mugala wa Shealtieli na Yozwè mwene Yosadaki n’abandi bene wâbo banalibasigîre, abadâhwa n’Abaleviti n’abandi boshi banarhenga emunda bali bahêsirwe bujà kujà e Yeruzalemu, barhondêra okuyîmika Abaleviti ba kurhenga myâka makumi abirhi na kujà enyanya mpu bagendêse bwinjà emikolo y’enyumpa ya Nyakasane. <verse eid="EZR 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 3:9"/>Yozwè n’abagala na bene wâbo, Kadmieli n’abagala, bene Yûda, banacicîhira haguma mpu barhambule abakozi b’aka-Nyamuzinda na bene Henadadi n’abâna bâbo na bene wâbo boshi Baleviti. <verse eid="EZR 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 3:10"/>Amango abanyakasi bayunjuzagya eciriba c’aka-Nyamuzinda, abadâhwa bayisha n’emyambalo yâbo n’emishekera, n’Abaleviti badwîrhe embale zâbo, mpu bakuze Nyakasane nk’oku Daudi mwâmi w’Israheli anali arhegesire. <verse eid="EZR 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 3:11"/>Barhondêra okukuza Nyakasane: bulya kuli kwinjà na obo­njo bwâge oku bene Israheli buli bw’ensiku n’amango. N’olubaga loshi lwakabanda orhuhababo rhw’amasîma omu kukuza Nyakasane bulya bamabanda eciriba c’aka-Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="EZR 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 3:12"/>Badâhwa banji, n’Abaleviti n’abashamuka b’emilala, abâli babwîne aka-Nyamuzinda karhanzi barhengamwo abakalaka n’izù linene ago mango banasimikaga eciriba c’enyumpa; na bandi banji bakabanda orhuhababo rhw’okushagaluka n’okusîma. <verse eid="EZR 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 3:13"/>Olubaga lurhankacimanyire oluli lubî lw’orhuhababo rhw’amasîma n’endûlù z’okulaka kwalo, bulya olubaga lwamakayâma bwenêne n’olwo lubî lwajà kuli.<verse eid="EZR 3:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EZR 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Okuyîmanzibwa kw’emikolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 4:1"/>Erhi abashombanyi ba Yûda na Benyamini bayumva oku balya bantu barhengaga emunda bali balulizîbwe bakola badwîrhe bayûbaka aka­ Nyamuzinda ka Nyamubâho w’Israheli, <verse eid="EZR 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 4:2"/>banaciyisha emunda Zorobabeli ali na Yozwè<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuharâmya Nyamuzinda: kuli kumuhûna oburhabâle, kumuhamagaza ci bwenêne omu ka-Nyamuzinda. Olwo luderho luyirukir’iboneka omu citabu c’Enganîro: <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 22:19">1 Nga 22, 19</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 17:4">2 Nga 17, 4</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 31:21">31, 21</ref></char>.</char></note> n’abarhambo ba ngasi milala, banacibabwîra mpu: Muleke rhuyûbake haguma rhweshi ako ka-Nyamuzinda, bulya nîrhu anali oyo Nyamuzinda winyu ye rhunaharâmya kurhenga amango g'Asaradoni, mwâmi w’e Sîriya, ye wa rhuyinamuliraga eno munda. <verse eid="EZR 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 4:3"/>Ci konene Zorobabeli, na Yozwè n’abandi bashamuka b’emilala y’Abayahudi banacibashuza, mpu: Kurhashingânîni murharhabâle okuyûbaka enyumpa ya Nyamuzinda. Guli mukolo gwîrhu rhwêne gw’okuyûbakira Nyamubâho Nyamuzinda w’Israheli nk’oku mwâmi Sirusi w’e Persi anarhurhegekaga. <verse eid="EZR 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 4:4"/>Lêro olwo lubaga lwanacijaho lwarhondêra okubulîsa olubaga lw’Abayahudi omurhima gw’okuyûbaka. <verse eid="EZR 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 4:5"/>Banacihongera abahanuzi babî mpu bakahà olubaga amahano mabî lyo balek’iyûbaka. Banacijira ntyo omu mango mwâmi Sirusi w’e Persi anali oku ntebe goshi kuhika omu kuyîma kwa Dariusi naye mwâmi w’e Persi.<verse eid="EZR 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Entambala y'Abasamâriya kuli Zerzesi na Artazerzesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 4:6"/>N’amango Zerzesi ali akola mwâmi, banayandika amaruba g’okushobeka abantu b’e Buyahudi n’ab’e Yeruzalemu. <verse eid="EZR 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 4:7"/>N’omu mango g’Artazerzesi, Bishilamu, Mitredati, Tabeeli n’abâbo boshi banaciyandikira Artazerzesi mwâmi w’e Persi amaruba omu Ciharamiya. <verse eid="EZR 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 4:8"/>Omurhambo Rehumu n’omwandisi Shimeshayi banaciyandikira Artazerzesi amaruba gali gadesire ntya oku biyêrekîre Yeruzalemu. <verse eid="EZR 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 4:9"/>Mpu rhwono: Rehumu, ye oligi murhambo, na Shimeshayi, ye mwandisi n’abâbo; abacîranuzi, abajà-bugo n’abakozi; ab’e Huruki, ab’e Babiloni, ab’e Suza, bo baligi b’e Elamu, <verse eid="EZR 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 4:10"/>kuguma n’agandi mashanja ag’olya muntu mukulu bwenêne n’owajir’irenge, ye Asurbanipali, yêne ahêkaga anagend’ibayûbakira omu cishagala ca Samâriya n’omu bindi bishagala by’ishiriza lya Efrata.<verse eid="EZR 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 4:11"/>Alaga ago maruba barhumiraga mwâmi Artazerzesi mpu: «Bambali bâwe abayûbaka olundi lunda lw’Olwîshi lwa Efrata. <verse eid="EZR 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 4:12"/>Mwâmi amanye oku balya Buyahudi bayinamukaga emwâwe, barhurhinzirekwo hano Yeruzalemu; bakola badwîrhe bayûbaka lulya lugo lubà cikanyi cirhagomba, lukaliha bwenêne; bakola badwîrhe bayîmanza enkûta n’okuzibuhya buhyâhya eciriba câlo. <verse eid="EZR 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 4:13"/>Mwâmi ayôrhage amanyire oku erhi olwo lugo lwankanayûbakwa, n’enkûta zâlwo erhi zankanashub’iyîmanzibwa, abo bantu barhakacivurha, nîsi erhi okurhûla mwâmi n’okuhongera obuhashe bw’okugera, n’okwo guli muhona munene oku bwâmi. <verse eid="EZR 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 4:14"/>Bulya rhwono, nk’oku rhulya omunyu omu bwâmi, kurharhushingânîni okubona mwâmi agayaguzibwa, rhwamarhuma emwa mwâmi emyanzi y’okumumanyisa okwo. <verse eid="EZR 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 4:15"/>Bagend’ilongereza omu bitabu by’okukengêza bya basho wanamanya oku olwo lugo lubà cikanyi cirhagomba, lwalibuzize abâmi n’abaluzi; wabona oku kurhenga mîra erhi kugoma banagoma. <verse eid="EZR 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 4:16"/>Rhumanyisize mwâmi oku erhi olwo lugo lwankanashub’iyûbakwa n’erhi enkûta zâlwo zankanashub’iyîmanzibwa, kuli okwo konene orhankacibà n’akantu nk’olundi lunda lw’olwîshi lwa Efrata.»<verse eid="EZR 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 4:17"/>Mwâmi agalula eri ishuzo: emw’omurhambo Rehumu, n’emwa Shimeshayi owali mwandisi n’emw’abâbo boshi banabà e Samâriya n’omu bindi bihugo binabà olundi lunda lwa Efrata, erhi: murhûla! <verse eid="EZR 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 4:18"/>Amaruba mwarhurhumiraga gasomirwe bwinjà bwinjà, ganayumvikana embere zîrhu. <verse eid="EZR 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 4:19"/>Nahânyire irhegeko, banajà bafûkula, banashanga oku nêci kurhenga mîra olwo lugo lurhahusa kugomera abâmi, n’oku banajamwo enshumishumi n’okucîhindula dubaduba. <verse eid="EZR 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 4:20"/>Aha Yeruzalemu hakola hayimire abâmi b’obuhashe bunji, barhegeka ecihugo c’olundi lunda lwa Efrata, banakabavurhira, okurharhûla n’okuhonga obuhashe bw’okugera. <verse eid="EZR 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 4:21"/>Kuli okwo muhane irhegeko ly’okuyimanza emikolo y’abo bantu, lyo olwo lugo lulek’ishub’iyûbakwa, kuhika amango nakurhegeka niene. <verse eid="EZR 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 4:22"/>Mumanye mwankanabula bushîbirira okwo, ly’obubî bulek’iyûshûka oku muhona gwa mwâmi.<verse eid="EZR 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 4:23"/>Okubundi erhi ago maruba ga mwâmi Artazerzesi gasomwa embere za Rehumu, Shimeshayi ye wali mwandisi, boshi haguma n’abâbo balîkûlira duba duba e Yeruzalemu emw’Abayahudi, babayimangiza emikolo n’obukali n’emisî. <verse eid="EZR 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 4:24"/>Okubundi obwo bayîmanza okwo kukola oku ka-Nyamuzinda aha Yeru zalemu; kwanaciyîmanzibwa ntyo myâka ibirhi kurhenga okuyîma kwa Dariusi mwâmi w’e Persi.<verse eid="EZR 4:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EZR 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Okuyûbaka aka-Nyamuzinda n’oku bakayunjuzagya (520-515)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 5:1"/>Abalêbi Hageyo na Zakariya, mwene Ido, banacimanyîsa Abayahudi b’e Buyahudi n’ab’e Yeruzalemu ebinwa by’obulêbi bya Nyamuzinda w’Israheli bâli badwîrhe. <verse eid="EZR 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 5:2"/>Lêro obwo, Zorobabeli mwene Shealtieli, na Yozwè mugala wa Yosadoki, bacîrhulira oku mikolo, bashubirira okuyûbaka aka-Nyamuzinda aha Yeruzalemu. Bali bayimangîrwe n’abo balêbi ba Nyamuzi nda. <verse eid="EZR 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 5:3"/>Muli ago mango, gonênè, Tatenayi, ye waligi murhambo w’ishiriza ly’olwîshi lwa Efrata, Shetarboznayi n’abâbo, banacijà emunda bali, banacibadôsa mpu: Ndi wabahâga obuhashe bw’okuyûbaka eyi nyumpa n’okuyîmanza ezîra nkuta? <verse eid="EZR 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 5:4"/>Lêro rhwanacibadôsa nti: Amazîno g’abayûbaka eyo nyumpa bo ba ndi? <verse eid="EZR 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 5:5"/>Ci isù lya Nyamuzinda lyàli oku bashamuka b’Abayahudi; barhanahash’igibacîka okuyûbaka kuhika omwanzi gwahika kuli Dariusi na kuhika babà galulira amaruba kuli okwo.<verse eid="EZR 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 5:6"/>Empamîso ly’ago mamba Tatenayi ye waligi murhambo w’ishiriza ly’olwîshi lwa Efrata n’abâbo Shetarboznayi n’abâbo b’e Arfasaka babaga ishiriza ly’o lwîshi lwa Efrata yanacihika kuli mwâmi Dariusi. <verse eid="EZR 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 5:7"/>Banacimurhumira ogwo mwanzi, n’ebyali biyandisirwe by’ebi: Omurhûla emwa Nnawîrhu Dariusi gugandâze bwenêne! <verse eid="EZR 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 5:8"/>Mwâmi amanye oku rhwajire omu lugo ly’Obuyahudi, aha nyumpa ya Nyamuzinda mukulu. Edwîrhe yayûbakwa n’amabuye manene n’emirhi edwîrhe yayongoberera omu nkuta. Ogwo mukolo gudwîrhe gwajirwa ntyo gunagendesire bwinjà omu maboko gâbo. <verse eid="EZR 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 5:9"/>Lêro obwo rhwanacidôsa abo bashamuka, rhwababwîra ntya nti: Ndi wabahâga obuhashe bw’okuyûbaka eyi nyumpa n’okuyîmusa ezi nkuta? <verse eid="EZR 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 5:10"/>Rhwanabahûnyire amazîno gâbo nti rhukumanyîse go, ly’oyandika amazîno g’abantu babakulîre.<verse eid="EZR 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 5:11"/>N’oku barhushuzize k’oku: Mpu rhuli barhumisi ba Nyamuzinda w’empingu n’igulu, rhwono rhwashub’iyûbaka enyumpa yarhangig’iyûbakwa mîra hamagera myâka minji, yayûbakagwa, yanayunjuzibwa n’omwâmi mukulu w’Israheli. <verse eid="EZR 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 5:12"/>Ci konene erhi ababusi bîrhu bacishologosa Nyamuzinda w’empingu, abahâna mpira omu maboko ga Nabukondonozori, mwâmi w’e Babiloni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okushâbûlwa kw’eyo nyumpa omu mwâka gwa 587 bwàli buhane Nyamuzinda ahâga olubaga lwâge erhi byâha byâlwo birhuma.</char></note>. Ye Munya-Kaldeya washâbaga eyo nyumpa, n’olubaga aluhêka bujà e Babiloni. <verse eid="EZR 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 5:13"/>Ci konene omu mwâka murhanzi gwa Dariusi, kurhenga ali mwâmi omu Babiloni, mwâmi Sirusi anacihâna irhegeko mpu ako ka-Nyamuzinda kashub’iyûbakwa, <verse eid="EZR 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 5:14"/>Kwo na kuguma mwâmi Sirusi anacikûla omu nyumpa y’okuhêrera aha Babiloni ngasi kalugu k’amasholo erhi ka marhale mwâmi Nebukondonozori arhenzagya muli ako ka-Nyamuzinda kali aha Yeruzalemu banakahêka omu luhêro e Babiloni; abihà muntu muguma izîno lyâge ye Sheshbazari, oyu mwâmi ayîmikaga murhambo. <verse eid="EZR 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 5:15"/>Anacimubwîra erhi: «Rhôla ebi birugu, ogend’ibibîka omu ka-Nyamuzinda kali aha Yeruzalemu; n’eyo nyumpa eyûbakirwe halya yanabaga». <verse eid="EZR 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 5:16"/>Okubundi obwôla Sheshbazari anaciyisha anagwîka amabuye g’omurhondêro gw’ako ka-Nyamuzinda kali aha Yeruzalemu kurhenga ago mango kuhika buno kuyûbakwa kanayûbakwa, karhanaciyunjula.<verse eid="EZR 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 5:17"/>Na bunôla, akabà mwâmi akulonzize, bajè bafûkula omu nyumpa y’e mbîko za mwâmi, aho Babiloni, lyo bamanya erhi kwo binali mwâmi Sirusi anarhegesire okuyûbaka akwo ka-Nyamuzinda kali aha Yeruzalemu. Buzinda bwaho mwâmi anarhumanyîsa kuli okwo.<verse eid="EZR 5:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EZR 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 6:1"/>Okubundi, mwâmi Dariusi anacirhegeka mpu bagend’ifûkula embîko bakazâg’ibîkiramwo ebirugu aha Babiloni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eryo izîno lya Babiloni kuli kulonza okuderha nkaba ecihugo coshi (rhulole muli <char style="xt"><ref loc="EZR 5:17">Ezr 5, 17</ref></char>).</char></note>. <verse eid="EZR 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 6:2"/>Aha Ekbatani, mûbako muguma gwàli omu murhundu gw’e Mêdi; banacifulûlamwo muzinge muguma bali bayandisiremwo, mpu: Eby’okukengêzibwa.<verse eid="EZR 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 6:3"/>Omu mwâka murhanzi gwa mwâmi, Sirusi, mwâmi Sirusi ali ahânyire irhegeko, erhi: Aka-Nyamuzinda kabà aha Yeruzalemu. Eyo nyumpa e shub’iyûbakwa, eyôrhe nyumpa ya nterekêro, eciriba câyo naco cishub’iyûbakwa. Obulî bwâyo bubè bwa makoro makumi galindarhu, n’oburherema makoro makumi galindarhu. <verse eid="EZR 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 6:4"/>Cijirwe na makondo asharhu ga mabuye gakombezibwe bwinjà, na mulongo muguma gwa mpaho. Ebirugu by’okuyûbaka eyo nyumpa byalolwa n’omulala gwa mwâmi. <verse eid="EZR 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 6:5"/>Na kandi bagalule ebirugu by’amasholo n’eby’amarhale by’omu ka-Nyamuzinda.<verse eid="EZR 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 6:6"/>Bunôla Tatenayi, murhambo w’olundi lunda lw’olwîshi lwa Efrata, Shetarboznayi n’abâbo b’e Arfasaka, abâli ishiriza ly’olwîshi: Muciyêgûle n’eyo munda, <verse eid="EZR 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 6:7"/>munaleke emikolo y’okuyûbaka ako ka-Nyamuzinda ejirwe bwinjà. Omurhambo w’Abayahudi n’abashamuka b’Abayahudi bayûbake eyo nyumpa ya Nyamuzinda aha enaba. <verse eid="EZR 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 6:8"/>Alaga irhegeko nkuhîre liyêrekîre ebi wajira n’abo bashamuka b’Abayahudi omu kuyûbaka ako ka-Nyamuzinda: Oku birugu bya mwâmi, byarhenga oku mpongano y’ishiriza ly’olwîshi, bikolêsibwe omu kulyûla bwinjà abo bantu, lyo halek’ibà amango barhayûbasiri. <verse eid="EZR 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 6:9"/>Eby’obulagîrire oku nterekêro ya Nyamuzinda w’empingu: emicûkà y’empanzi, engandabuzi, abâna-buzi, engano, omunyu, idivayi n’amavurha, nk’oku abadâhwa bali aha Yeruzalemu banahûnyire ngasi lusiku buzira kubulikana kantu kalebe, <verse eid="EZR 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 6:10"/>ntyo banahâna enterekêro y’akisûnunu kinjà, bahêre Nyamuzinda w’empingu, banakashenga, mwâmi alame bwinjà, kuguma n’abâna bâge. <verse eid="EZR 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 6:11"/>Kandi nshubir’ihâna eri irhegeko: Erhi hankajira owahindula akantu kuli obu burhegesi bwâni, banakûle omutungo omu nyumpa yâge, banamumanikekwo na kuli okwo enyumpa yâge eshandwe. <verse eid="EZR 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 6:12"/>Nyamuzinda wahiraga izîno lyâge omwo ashabûle ngasi mwâmi na ngasi lubaga lwankayimusa okuboko mpu lujire kundi kundi, nîsi erhi okuhongola ako ka-Nyamuzinda kali aha Yeruzalemu! Nie Mwâmi Dariusi mpanyire elyo irhegeko, kukwânîne lishimbwe bwinjà na duba.<verse eid="EZR 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 6:13"/>Okubundi Tatenayi, murhambo w’olundi lunda lw’olwîshi lwa Efrata, Shetarboznayi n’abâbo banacishimba duba duba okwo mwâmi Dariusi àli arhegesire. <verse eid="EZR 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 6:14"/>Nabo balya bashamuka b’Abayahudi banacirhondêra okuyûbaka n’omukolo gwâbo gwababêra, bulya bali bayimangîrwe n’abalêbi Hageyo na Zakariya mwene Ido. Banaciyunjuza nka kulya Nyamuzinda w’Israheli anarhegeka na Cirusi, na Dariusi, na Artazerzesi, mwâmi w’e Persi. <verse eid="EZR 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 6:15"/>Eyo nyumpa bayibumba omu nsiku isharhu z’omwêzi gw’Adari<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwo kuderha kasikiru kazinda (mwêzi gwa kabirhi) - lukanga (mwêzi gwa kasharhu) Adari mwâka 515.</char></note>, omu mwâka gwa kali ndarhu kurhenga Dariusi ali mwâmi. <verse eid="EZR 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 6:16"/>Bene Israheli, abadâhwa, Abaleviti, n’abasigalaga boshi muli balya bali bahesirwe bujà, ngasi banayololagwa boshi, bajira olusiku lukulu lw’okugishwa kw’ako ka-Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="EZR 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 6:17"/>Barherekêra kuli olwo lusiku lw’okugishwa kw’aka-Nyamuzinda, mpanzi igana, ngandabuzi magana abirhi, bâna-buzi magana anni n’oku mpyûlo y’ebyâha bya bene Israheli boshi barhûla bihebe ikumi na bibirhi nk’oku amashanja g’Israheli ganali. <verse eid="EZR 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 6:18"/>Banaciyîmika abadâhwa nk’oku banagabanyikaga, n’Abaleviti oku mirhwe y’okuhêra Nyamuzinda aha Yeruzalemu, kulya binayandisirwe omu citabu ca Mûsa.<verse eid="EZR 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Basâka w’omwâka gwa 515 embere za Kristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 6:19"/>Abo bali bahesirwe bujà, banayagaluka, bajira olusiku lukulu lwa Basâka omu nsiku ikumi n’ini z’omwêzi gwa burhanzi. <verse eid="EZR 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 6:20"/>Ebwa kubà abadâhwa n’Abaleviti bali bamacicêsa boshi oku banali, bakolaga bacîre; banacirherekêra Basâka kuli bo bônene. <verse eid="EZR 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 6:21"/>Ntyo, bene Israheli banarhengaga bujà balya Basâka, kuguma na balya bacîyegulaga oku ngeso ngalugalu z’abapagani, bacîhira kulibo omu kulonza Nyamubâho, Nyamuzinda w’Israheli. <verse eid="EZR 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 6:22"/>Nsiku nda zoshi erhi bakuza n’obusîme bunene olusiku lukulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Olusiku lukulu lw’emigati erhalimwo ngezo: <char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 12:15-20">Lub 12, 15-20</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:6-8">Lev 23, 6-8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 30:21">2 Nga 30, 21</ref></char>.</char></note> lw’emigati erhalimwo ngezo, bulya Nyamubâho amabasîmîsa erhi abayerekeza omurhima gwa mwâmi w’e Asîriya, mpu abarhabâle muli ogwo mukolo gw’okuyûbaka enyumpa ya Nyamubâho, Nyamuzinda w’Israheli.<verse eid="EZR 6:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EZR 7"/>
  <para style="ms1">II. Ezra na Nehemiya bayûbaka ecinyabuguma</para>
  <para style="s1">Okubalama kwa Ezra n’obugo bwâge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 7:1"/>Enyuma ly’aho, amango Artazerzesi àli mwâmi w’e Persi, Ezra mugala wa Seraya, mugala w’Azarya, mugala wa Hilkiya, <verse eid="EZR 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 7:2"/>mugala wa Shalumu, mugala wa Sadoki, mugala w'Ahitubi, <verse eid="EZR 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 7:3"/>mugala w’Amarya, mugala wa Merayoti, <verse eid="EZR 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 7:4"/>mugala wa Zerahya, mugala wa Uzi, mugala wa Buki, <verse eid="EZR 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 7:5"/>mugala w’Abishuwa, mugala wa Pinasi, mugala wa Eleazari, mugala w’omudâhwa mukulu Aroni. <verse eid="EZR 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 7:6"/>Oyu Ezra anacisôka kurhenga e Babiloni. Ali mwandisi omanyîrîre enyigîrizo za Mûsa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ezra adesirwe mwandisi mukulu bwenêne w’enyigîrizo za Mûsa. Ali mukozi wa bulagîrire oku bwâmi e Persi (mulongo gwa 14). Ali ashangabusire omu kuyandika amarhegeko, ali mulenga w’amandiko na wa bushiru omu kugayigîriza (mulongo gwa 10).</char></note>, ezi Nyamubâho, Nyamuzinda w’Israheli ahânaga yêne. Kulya kubà okuboko kwa Nyamuzinda kwàli kuli ye, mwâmi anamuyêmêrera ngasi ebi anahûnaga byoshi. <verse eid="EZR 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 7:7"/>Banji omu bene Israheli, abadâhwa, Abaleviti, abimbiza, abalanzi b’enyumvi, Abanatineni, nabo basôkera e Yeruzalemu, omu mwâka gwa kali mwenda kurhenga Artazerzesi ali mwâmi. <verse eid="EZR 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 7:8"/>Ezra anacihika aha Yeruzalemu omu mwêzi gwa karhanu gw’ogwo mwâka gwa kali nda gw’okuyîma kwa mwâmi. <verse eid="EZR 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 7:9"/>Mwâli omu lusiku lurhanzi lw’omwêzi gwa burhanzi mwo arhangiraga okurherema arhenga e Babiloni, kandi mwâli omu lusiku lurhanzi lw’omwêzi gwa karhanu mwo ahisire aha Yeruzalemu, erhi okuboko kwa Nyamuzinda kuyunjwîre minjà kummulikwo. <verse eid="EZR 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 7:10"/>N’okwo ali ebwa kubà Ezra ali n’obushiru bw’okumanya Akanwa ka Nyamubâho, oku kushimba, n’okuyigîriza omw’Israheli amarhegeko n’engeso z’ecihugo.<verse eid="EZR 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amaruba ga Artazerzesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 7:11"/>Alaga amaruba mwâmi Artazerzesi ahâga Ezra mudâhwa na mwandisi muhugûzi w’ebinwa by’Irhegeko lya Nyamubâho, na ngasi gandi marhegeko gâge gayêrekîre Israheli.<verse eid="EZR 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 7:12"/>Artazerzesi, mwâmi w’abâmi, kuli Ezra, mudâhwa na mwandisi ayishi bwinjà irhegeko lya Nyamuzinda w’empingu, murhûla gwoshi kuli mwe. <verse eid="EZR 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 7:13"/>Nahânyire irhegeko nti ngasi b’omu bene Israheli, omu badâhwa n’omu Baleviti banali aha nshigirwa hoshi, balya banalonzize okujà e Yeruzalemu, banagenda nâwe. <verse eid="EZR 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 7:14"/>Bulya orhumirwe na mwâmi n’abahanûzi bâge nda mpu ogend’ilola kurhi Obuyahudi na Yeruzalemu biyôsire omu kukulikira akanwa ka Nyamuzinda wâwe, aka kanali omu kuboko kwâwe. <verse eid="EZR 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 7:15"/>Na mpu ohêrhe e nsaranga n’amasholo mwâmi yêne n’abahanuzi bâge bahânyire emwa Nyamuzinda w’Israheli oyûbasire omu Yeruzalemu. <verse eid="EZR 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 7:16"/>Na ngasi masholo erhi nsaranga wakanabona omu cihugo ca Babiloni coshi na ngasi bindi ohâbirwe n’olubaga n’abadâhwa oku nyumpa ya Nyamuzinda wâbo aha Yeruzalemu. <verse eid="EZR 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 7:17"/>Co carhuma ogend’igula empanzi, engandabuzi n’abâna-buzi n’enterekêro na ngasi bindi binazigendakwo, obirherekêrere oku luhêrero lw’aka-Nyamuzinda wâwe kabà aha Yeruzalemu. <verse eid="EZR 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 7:18"/>Ensaranga n’amasholo gasigîre, ojiremwo ngasi ebi onabwîne bikukwânîne na bene winyu omu kushimba obulonza bwa Nyamuzinda winyu. <verse eid="EZR 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 7:19"/>Odêkereze embere za Nyamuzinda w’e Yeruzalemu ebi birugu ohîrwe mpu bigend’ikakola omu ka-Nyamuzinda wâwe. <verse eid="EZR 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 7:20"/>Na ngasi bindi bya bulagîrire oku ka-Nyamuzinda wâwe, ebi ogwâsirwe okujira, wanabirhôla omu nyumpa y’embîko ya mwâmi. <verse eid="EZR 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 7:21"/>Niono mwâmi Artazerzesi mpanyire irhegeko oku babîsi boshi babà olundi lunda lw’olwîshi nti ngasi ebi Ezra, mudâhwa na mwandisi w’Akanwa ka Nnâmahanga ankanabahûna byoshi munabijire bwinjinjà. <verse eid="EZR 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 7:22"/>Kuhika oku talenta igana za nsaranga, birundo igana bya ngano, mikondo igana y’idivayi, mikondo igana ya mavurha, n’omunyu buzira kugera. <verse eid="EZR 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 7:23"/>Ngasi binarhegesirwe na Nyamuzinda w’empingu, binajirirwe duba kuli ako ka-Nyamuzinda kâge, lyo obukunizi bwâge bulek’iyîshira ecihugo ca mwâmi n’oku bagala. <verse eid="EZR 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 7:24"/>Kandi rhubamanyisize oku kuli abôla badâhwa, Abaleviti, abimbiza, abalanzi b’enyumvi, abà-Natineni, murhabavurhisagya ibarati erhi mpongano, erhi kubacîka omu njira. <verse eid="EZR 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 7:25"/>Nâwe Ezra, omu kukulikira obwenge Nyamuzinda wâwe akuhizire omu nfune, osinge abatwî b’emmanja, abarhambo barhambula olubaga loshi lunali eyo ishiriza ly’olwîshi, ngasi banamanyire amarhegeko ga Nyamuzinda wâwe, onagayigîrize abarhagayishi. <verse eid="EZR 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 7:26"/>Orhanashimbiri irhegeko lya Nyamuzinda wâwe, n’irhegeko lya mwâmi, anahanwe kulya kushingânîne: arhàyîrhwa akagwe erhi ahyûle, erhi ashwêkwe.<verse eid="EZR 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ezra asalira anarhenga e Babiloni ajà e Israheli-Palestina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 7:27"/>Ayâgirwe Nyamubâho Nyamuzinda w’ababusi bîrhu, owahiraga omu murhima gwa mwâmi okwo kukuza aka-Nyamuzinda kabà aha Yeruzalemu. <verse eid="EZR 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 7:28"/>Na owarhumaga nkundwa na mwâmi n’abahanûzi bâge n’abasirika bâge boshi banagwêrhe obuhashe. Nâni nacisêza bulya okuboko kwa Nyamubâho Nyamuzinda wâni kwo nayegemîre, nakaz’ishûbûza abarhambo b’Israheli nti ngende nabo.<verse eid="EZR 7:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EZR 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 8:1"/>Alaga abakulu b’omulala n’obûko bwâbo, balya barhengaga rhweshi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abalume barhengaga e Babiloni: boshi na Ezra bâli hôfi cihumbi ciguma na magana arhanu. Haguma n’abakazi n’abâna bâli hôfi bihumbi birhanu.</char></note> e Babiloni oku ngoma ya mwâmi Artazerzesi. <verse eid="EZR 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 8:2"/>Omu bene Pinasi: Gershomu; omu bene Hamati: Daniyeli; omu bene Daudi: Hatushi, <verse eid="EZR 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 8:3"/>mwene Shekanya; omu bene Pareosi: Zekariya na balume igana na makumi arhanu bayandisirwe omu citabu c’omulala. <verse eid="EZR 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 8:4"/>Omu bene Pahati-Mowabu; Eliyunayi, mwene Zeraya, na bantu magana abiri ga balume. <verse eid="EZR 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 8:5"/>Omu bene Zatu: Shekanya, mugala wa Yehazieli, na magana asharhu ga balume. <verse eid="EZR 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 8:6"/>Omu bene Adini: Ebedi, mugala wa Yônatani na balume makumi arhanu. <verse eid="EZR 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 8:7"/>Bene Elamu: Yeshaya, mugala wa Atalya na balume makumi gali nda. <verse eid="EZR 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 8:8"/>Omu bene Shefatya: Zebadya, mugala wa Mikaeli, na balume makumi gali munâni. <verse eid="EZR 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 8:9"/>Omu bene Yowabu: Obadiya mugala wa Yehieli, na balume magana abirhi na ikumi na munâni. <verse eid="EZR 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 8:10"/>Omu bene Bâni; Shelomiti, mugala wa Yosifya na balume igana na makumi gali ndarhu. <verse eid="EZR 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 8:11"/>Omu bene Bebayi: Zekarya, mugala wa Bebayi, na bantu makumi abirhi na munâni ga balume. <verse eid="EZR 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 8:12"/>Omu bene Azgadi: Yohanani, mugala wa Hakatani na balume igana n’ikumi. <verse eid="EZR 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 8:13"/>Omu bene Adonikami: emiziba, n’amazîno gâbo ga gano: Elifêleti, Yeieli, na Shemaya, na balume makumi gali ndarhu; <verse eid="EZR 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 8:14"/>omu bene Bigwayi: Utayi, mugala wa Zabudi, na balume makumi gali nda.<verse eid="EZR 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 8:15"/>Nabashûbûliza aha lwîshi luhululira olunda lw’Ahawa, rhwanacitwa icumbi, aho nsiku isharhu. Erhi mbà namalolêreza olubaga loshi, n’abadâhwa, ntabonagamwo owankaderhwa mwene Levi. <verse eid="EZR 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 8:16"/>Okubundi nanacirhuma abagula Eliezeri, Arieli, Shemaya, Elnatani, Yoyaribi, Elnatani, Natani, Zekarya na Meshulami, kuguma na abigiriza ba Yoyaribina na Elnatani. <verse eid="EZR 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 8:17"/>Nanacibarhuma emw’omushamuka Ido, emunda baderha mpu yo Kasifya. Nanacibahà ebinwa bali bagwâsirwe okugend’ibwîra Ido na bandi bene wâbo ba-Natineni babà aho Kasifya, lyo barhurhumira abagend’ikaz’ikola aka-Nyamuzinda wîrhu. <verse eid="EZR 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 8:18"/>Na ebwa kubà okuboko kwinjà kwa Nyamuzinda kurhulikwo, banacirhurhumira omuntu mwenge wa muli bene Mahali, mugala wa Levi mwene Israheli ye: Sherebya n’abagala bâge, na bene wâbo boshi bali ikumi na munâni. <verse eid="EZR 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 8:19"/>Bàrhuma na Hashabya na Yeshaya w’omu bene Merari. <verse eid="EZR 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 8:20"/>Bene wâbo na bagala bâbo boshi bâli makumi abirhi; bâli ba muli bene Natineni balya Daudi n’abashamuka bahûnaga mpu bakakolera Abaleviti, magana abirhi na makumi abirhi, boshi banaganjwa ngasi muguma n’izîno lyâge.<verse eid="EZR 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 8:21"/>Aho oku lwîshi lw’Ahawa naderha nti boshi bacîshalise lyo rhucîbabaza embere za Nyamuzinda wîrhu, lyo rhumushenga amabalame minjà kuli rhwe, oku bâna bîrhu n’oku bintu bîrhu. <verse eid="EZR 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 8:22"/>Bulya nakabwîne enshonyi z’okuhûna mwâmi nti arhurhumire engabo y’abasirika na banyakulwîra oku nfarasi mpu bajè barhucinga oku bashombayi bîrhu amango rhunali omu kubalama koshi, n’obwo rhwàli rhwamabwîra mwâmi oku: Okuboko kwa Nyamuzinda kulanga ebintu bya ngasi boshi banamulongereza, cikône emisî na obukunizi bwâge bunahonere oku bamulekêrera. <verse eid="EZR 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 8:23"/>Okwo kwarhuma rhucîshalisa, rhunashenga Nyamuzinda wîrhu naye anarhuyumvîrhiza.<verse eid="EZR 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 8:24"/>Nacîshoga badâhwa bakulu ikumi na babirhi bayûshûka kuli Sherebya, Hashabya na ikumi omu bene wâbo. <verse eid="EZR 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 8:25"/>Embere zâbo nakalenga ensaranga, amasholo n’ebirugu, nterekêro mwâmi agoshôlaga oku ka-Nyamuzinda wîrhu, ye n’abahanûzi bâge n’abarhambo bâge, na embere za hene Israheli banali aho. <verse eid="EZR 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 8:26"/>Nanacigera n’okubahêreza talenta magana gali ndarhu na makumi arhanu ga nsaranga; ebirugu by’amarhale byàli bya buzirho bwa talenta igana na talenta igana za masholo. <verse eid="EZR 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 8:27"/>Rhubêhe makumi abirhi rhwa masholo rhwa ngulo ya dariki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">edariki: luli lusaranga lwa masholo.</char></note> cihumbi, na byankizo bibirhi, bya mulinga gwakemeza gwa ngulo ndârhi nk’amasholo. <verse eid="EZR 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 8:28"/>Nanacibabwîra nti: Muli nshâgi za Nyamuzinda n’aga marhale n’aga masholo biri biberûlîrwe Nyamubâho, Nyamuzinda w’ababusi binyu. <verse eid="EZR 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 8:29"/>Mubè masù omu kubilanga kuhika amango mwashubibigerera embere z’abarhambo b’abadâhwa, Abaleviti, n’embere z’abarhambo b’emilala ya bene Israheli, aha Yeruzalemu omu biyûmpa by’aka-Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="EZR 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 8:30"/>Abadâhwa n’Abaleviti banacirhôla galya marhale, na galya masholo, oku bajà bagalênga n’ebirugu, mpu babihêke e Yeruzalemu omu nyumpa ya Nyamuzi nda wîrhu. <verse eid="EZR 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 8:31"/>Rhwanacirhenga aho lwîshi lw’Ahawa omu nsiku ikumi n’ibirhi z’omwêzi gwa burhanzi, rhwajà e Yeruzalemu. Okuboko kwa Nyamuzinda wîrhu kwanacirhujakwo, kwarhulikûza omu maboko g’abashombanyi n’omu mirhego minji ago mango rhwanayishaga rhwagenda.<verse eid="EZR 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 8:32"/>Rhwanacihika aha Yeruzalemu, rhwanacibêraho nsiku isharhu, <verse eid="EZR 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 8:33"/>omu lusiku lwa kani ensaranga, amasholo, ebirugu byoshi byashub’ilengwa omu mwa Nyamuzinda wîrhu, omu maboko g’omudâhwa Meremoti, mugala wa Uriya, mudâhwa wali na Eleazari mugala wa Pinasi, n’Abaleviti babirhi, Yesabadi, mugala wa Yozwè na Noadya, mugala wa Binuyi. <verse eid="EZR 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 8:34"/>Byoshi byahânwa nk’okwo byanaganjagwa n’obuzirho bwabyo, bwayandikwa ago mango. <verse eid="EZR 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 8:35"/>Ezo mpira zarhengaga emunda zàli zilulizîbwe zanacihâna enterekêro emwa Nyamuzinda w’Israheli: mpanzi ikumi n’ibirhi, kuli bene Israheli boshi, ngandabuzi makumi gali mwenda na ndarhu, bâna-buzi makumi gali nda na nda, bihebe ikumi na bibirhi, mpyûlo oku byâha; byoshi byarherekêrwa Nyamubâho. <verse eid="EZR 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 8:36"/>Banacimanyîsa galya marhegeko ga mwâmi, oku barhambo n’oku bandi bakulu banali ishiriza lya olwîshi; nabo banarhabâla olubaga kuli ako ka-Nyamuzinda.<verse eid="EZR 8:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EZR 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Abayahudi bahanzibwa obuhya n’agandi mashanja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 9:1"/>Erhi ebyo bibà byamanagenda ntyo, abashamuka banacinjaho, mpu: Olubaga lwa bene Israheli, abadâhwa, Abaleviti barhalekini n’amashanja g’ebi bihugo rhuyûbakînwe nabyo; bacidwîrhe bajira amaligo gâbyo: aga Abanyamisiri, Abanyamoreni, Abanyakanani, Abahititi, Abapereziti, Abayebuseni, Abamoniti n’Abamowabiti. <verse eid="EZR 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 9:2"/>Kulya kubà bajir’isheberayo abakazi, kuli bo bônene n’oku bâna bâbo na ntyo olubaga lutagatîfu lwamacîshwêkera kuli ago mashanja g’ebyo bihugo n’amaboko g’abarhambo n’abatwî b’emmanja go gabire ga burhanzi omu kuhenya maligo ga bene ago. <verse eid="EZR 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 9:3"/>Erhi nyumva ntyo, na sharhangula emyambalo yâni n’ecishûli câni, nacîmanyula emviri okw’irhwe, n’obwânwa, natamala nieshi n’omutula. <verse eid="EZR 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 9:4"/>Aha burhambi bwâni banacilambûkiraho nabo balya banali balumirwe n’ebinwa bya Nnâmahanga w’Israheli erhi bubî bw’abo bâli balulize burhuma; nâni nanaciyôrha ncigonyire kuhika oku nterekêro y’ebijingo. <verse eid="EZR 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 9:5"/>Erhi amango g’enterekêro y’ebijingo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Enterekêro y’ebijinjo yakag’ibà aha nsâ mwenda w’ebijingo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 18:29">1 Bâm 18, 29</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 9:21">9, 21</ref></char>).</char></note> ganabà, nayîsha najonjoboka na gulya mutula gwâni n’erya mishangi n’ecishûli câni bisharhangusire; nanacifukama, nanaciyinamulira amaboko emunda Nyamuzinda wâni ali, <verse eid="EZR 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 9:6"/>nanaciderha, nti: Yâgirwa Nyamubâho, niono nyunjwîre mungo na mutula birhankarhuma nacîshomya nti ngalamire emunda oli, bulya amabî gîrhu gayûshûsire, garhaluka olugero, na ntyo obubî bwîrhu bwarhaluka amalunga. <verse eid="EZR 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 9:7"/>Kurhenga amango ga bashakulûza kuhika buno erhi n’omu mabî rhunali na byâha bîrhu byarhumaga rhuhêkwa bujà, rhwanyagwa, rhwabona enshonyi nk’oku binali ene. <verse eid="EZR 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 9:8"/>Ci konene buno, Nyakasane, Nyamuzinda wîrhu arhanzirirhubêra obwonjo erhi alanga muli rhwe emisigala, anarhuha aha rhwayâkira omu hantu hâge hatagatîfu lyo Nyamuzinda wîrhu arhuyigula amasù, anarhuhè akalamo muli omu bujà bwîrhu. <verse eid="EZR 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 9:9"/>Nêci rhuli bajà, ci konene arharhulekêreraga muli obo bujà. Ajizire abâmi b’e Persi bakarhulola n’omurhima gw’obwonjo, mpu lyo rhubà n’akalamo, lyo rhunayishiyimanza enyumpa ya Nyamuzinda wîrhu, rhushub’ishakûlula, anarhuhè aha rhwakabêra ahazungulusirwe n’olugurhu omu Buyahudi n’omu Yeruzalemu. <verse eid="EZR 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 9:10"/>Na buno, Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda wîrhu, bicigi rhwankaciderha enyuma ly’oku koshi? <verse eid="EZR 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 9:11"/>Bulya rhwalekêrîre amarhegeko warhuhâga omu kanwa k’abalêbi, wanarhukomêreza, erhi: Eco cihugo mwajamwo mpu mugend’iciyimamwo, ciri cihugo ca mabî, mabî g’amashanja na ngasi bulyâlya bunabalimwo, kurhenga olunda n’olundi erhi na mabî gâbo gônene. <verse eid="EZR 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 9:12"/>Na buno mumanyâge mwankahà bâli binyu bagala bâbo, na bagala binyu mumanye mwankabahà bâli bâbo; munamanye irhondo murhayagalagwa n’omurhûla gwâbo erhi n’iragi lyâbo lyo muzibuha, lyo muhashilya oku binjà by’eci cihugo, munayîsh’ibisigira abâna binyu ensiku zoshi!<verse eid="EZR 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 9:13"/>Kuli ebi bibî byarhuyîshiraga erhi bijiro bîrhu bigalugalu birhuma ciru akabà mpu orhabîkaga ecirhali cihimbi c’amabî gîrhu, Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda wîrhu, wanarhulekera n’omusigala nk’ogu guli aha, <verse eid="EZR 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 9:14"/>ka rhwankacîshomya mpu rhwashub’ivuna amarhegeko gâwe. rhushub’ilungana n’aga mashanja magalugalu ntya? Ka lêro orhankarhubêra burhè kuhika orhuhungumule buzira kurhulekera ciru n’omusigala, ciru n’ehiguma hyankafulumuka? <verse eid="EZR 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 9:15"/>Nyamubâho, Nyamuzinda w’Israheli. oli mushinganyanya loshi, rhwe rhuligi gulya musigala gw’abashugunukaga, embere zâwe n’amabî gîrhu rhurhacikwânîni okubêra omu masù gâwe erhi ago mabî gîrhu garhuma.<verse eid="EZR 9:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EZR 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 10:1"/>Amango Ezra akazâg’irhoza emirenge erhi anafukamire embere z’aka-Nyamuzinda, oku adwîrhe ashenga ntyo, engabo nyinji y’abalume n’abakazi n’abâna ba bene Israheli yamuja eburhambi, bulya olubaga loshi lwàli omu mulenge bwenêne. <verse eid="EZR 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 10:2"/>Okubundi Shekanya, mwene Yehieli, wa muli bene Elamu, anacirhôla oluhyà abwîra Ezra, erhi: Rhwagomîre Nnâmahanga omu kuyanka abakazi b’omu gandi mashanja. Hyakwikubagirwa higuma hyône hicisigalire Israheli. <verse eid="EZR 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 10:3"/>Rhushub’igilagana na Nyamubâho Nyamuzinda wîrhu oku rhukolaga rhwagend’ihulusa abo bakazi boshi n’abâna bâbo nka kulya onarhuhanwîre Waliha, mwe na bandi bacirhînya amarhegeko ga Nyamuzinda wîrhu. N’okwo kunabè nk’oku irhegeko lidesire. <verse eid="EZR 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 10:4"/>Yîmuka ojire omukolo gwâwe. Nîrhu rhwakugwâsa. Ozibuhe, kanya omu mirimo. <verse eid="EZR 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 10:5"/>Ezra anaciyimuka, alahiriza abakulu b’abadâhwa n’ab’Abaleviti, na bene Israheli boshi mpu banajag’ijira nk’okwo binadesirwe; nabo bacîgasha. <verse eid="EZR 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 10:6"/>Erhi ahuluka omu ka­-Nyamuzinda, Ezra anacijà omu mwa Yohâna, mugala wa Eliyashibu; n’oku ajamwo arhaderhaga mpu ankalyamwo omugati erhi okunywamwo amîshi, mungo gw’obubî bwa balya halibahêsirwe bujà gurhuma.<verse eid="EZR 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 10:7"/>Banaciyâliza omu Buyahudi boshi n’omu Yeruzalemu, mpu ngasi banali bahesirwe bujà babugânane boshi aha Yeruzalemu. <verse eid="EZR 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 10:8"/>Na kuli okwo abarhambo n’abagula bali babarhonzire oku ngasi orhali ho enyuma lya nsiku isharhu, banamunyage, banamukûle omu ndêko y’abo bâli halulizîbwe. <verse eid="EZR 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 10:9"/>Abantu b’e Yûda boshi na bene Benyamini banacidêka aha Yeruzalemu enyuma ly’ezo nsiku isharhu; zàli omu nsiku makumi abirhi z’omwêzi gwa mwenda. Olubaga loshi lwanacisikanana omu muhanda gw’aka-Nyamuzinda erhi lunali lwageramwo omusisi gw’okwo kugalugalu, n’ogw’enkuba nyinji yakazâg’inia. <verse eid="EZR 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 10:10"/>Omudâhwa Ezra anaciyimanga ababwîra, erhi: Mwajizire kubî erhi muyanka abakazi b’ahandi, mwayûshûla ntyo obubî oku bundi bubî bwa bene Israheli. <verse eid="EZR 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 10:11"/>Na buno muciyunjuzagye kuli obwo bubî bwinyu embere za Nyamubâho, Nyamuzinda w’ababusi binyu, munakajira oku alonzize; muciyêgûle n’embaga z’ebindi bihugo, munaleke abakazi b’ahandi. <verse eid="EZR 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 10:12"/>Endêko yoshi yanacishuza n’izù linene, yanaciderha mpu: Kwo rhwajira okwo odesire! <verse eid="EZR 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 10:13"/>Ci konene olubaga lwamaluga, na mwa gano mango g’enkuba kurhankahashikana okubêra embuga: kandi lurhali lubanja lwa lusiku luguma erhi ibirhi, n’okubà ebyâha bîrhu biri binji muli okwo. <verse eid="EZR 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 10:14"/>Abarhambo bîrhu bayimange ahâli h’olubaga: na ngasi boshi banayansire abakazi b’ahandi, omu bishagala bîrhu, bayishe omu lusiku banatwîrîrwe, bayishe n’abashamuka n’abacîranuzi ba ngasi cishagala, kuhika oburhè bwa Nyamuzinda wîrhu burhuyêgûkekwo erhi okwo kurhuma.<verse eid="EZR 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 10:15"/>Yônatani mwene Asaheli na Yahazya, mwene Tikwa, bônene barhali bayêmîre okwo; Meshulami n’Omuleviti Shabtayi babagwâsa. <verse eid="EZR 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 10:16"/>Ci abandi bali bahêsirwe bujà boshi banajira nk’oku byanali bidesirwe. Omudâhwa Ezra, acîshoga abarhambo b’emilala nk’oku enyumpa zâbo zinali, ngasi muguma kulya anacîshogagwa mpu lebè oyu; bashimânana omu lusiku lurhanzi lw’omwêzi gwa kali ikumi mpu balolage kurhi batwa olwo lubanja. <verse eid="EZR 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 10:17"/>Bagend’iyûsa omu lusiku lurhanzi lw’omwêzi gwa burhanzi ezo manja z’abayankaga abakazi b’ahandi. Olukere lw’abayâzire <verse eid="EZR 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 10:18"/>Omu badâhwa ababonekinemwo bali bayansire abakazi b’ahandi bali: omu bene Yozwè, mugala wa Yosadaki na bene wâbo: Maseya, Eliyezeri, Yaribu na Gedalya; <verse eid="EZR 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 10:19"/>balagânana oku bahulusa abo bakâbo; n’omu kuyêmêra oku babihire, balagânana okurherekêra engandabuzi kuli obwo bubî bwâbo. <verse eid="EZR 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 10:20"/>Omu bene Imeri: Hanani na Zebadya. <verse eid="EZR 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 10:21"/>Omu bene Harimi; Maseya, Eliya, Shemaya, Yehieli na Uziya. <verse eid="EZR 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 10:22"/>Omu bene Pashehuri: Eliyehoyenayi, Maseya, Ismaeli, Netaneli, Yozabadi, Shimeyi na Eleasa. <verse eid="EZR 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 10:23"/>Omu Baleviti: Yozabadi, Shimeyi, Kelaya oderhwa Kelita, Petahya, Yehuda na Eliezeri. <verse eid="EZR 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 10:24"/>Omu bîmbiza: Eliashibi na Zakuru; omu balanzi b’enyumvi: Shalumu, Telemi na Uri. <verse eid="EZR 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 10:25"/>Omu bene Israheli: Bagala ba Pareosi: Ramiya, Yiziya, Malkiya, Miamini, Eleazari, Malkiya na Benaya; <verse eid="EZR 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 10:26"/>omu bene Elamu: Matanya, Zekariya, Yehieli, Abdi, Yeremoti na Eliya. <verse eid="EZR 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 10:27"/>Omu bene Zatu: Eliyehoyenayi, Eliashibu, Matanya, Yeremoti, Zabadi na Aziza; <verse eid="EZR 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 10:28"/>omu bene Bebayi: Yohanani, Hananya, Zabayi, Atlayi; <verse eid="EZR 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 10:29"/>omu bene Bigirayi: Meshulami, Maluku, Adaya, Yashubu, Yishali, Yeramoti. <verse eid="EZR 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 10:30"/>Omu bene Pahati-Mowabu: Adna, Kelali, Benaya, Maseya, Matanya, Besaleli, Menashè; <verse eid="EZR 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 10:31"/>omu bene Harimi: Eliezeri, Yishiya, Malkiya, Shemaya, Simoni, <verse eid="EZR 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 10:32"/>Benyamini, Maluku, Shemariya; <verse eid="EZR 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 10:33"/>omu bene Hashumu: Matenayi, Matatya, Zabadi, Elifêleti, Yeremayi, Menashè, Shimeyi; <verse eid="EZR 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 10:34"/>omu bene Bâni: Madayi, Amrami, Uweli, <verse eid="EZR 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 10:35"/>Benaya, Bedya, Kelaya, <verse eid="EZR 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 10:36"/>Wanya, Meremoti, Eliyashibu, <verse eid="EZR 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 10:37"/>Matanya, Matenayi, Yasayi. <verse eid="EZR 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 10:38"/>Omu bene Binuyi; Shimeyi, <verse eid="EZR 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 10:39"/>Shelemiya, Natani na Adaya. <verse eid="EZR 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 10:40"/>Omu bene Zakayi: Makenadebayi, Shashayi, Sharayi, <verse eid="EZR 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 10:41"/>Azareli, Shelemiya, Shemariya, <verse eid="EZR 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 10:42"/>Shalumu, Amariya, Yozefu; <verse eid="EZR 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 10:43"/>omu bene Nebo: Yeieli, Matitiya, Zabadi, Zebina, Yadayi, Yoweli, Benaya. <verse eid="EZR 10:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 10:44"/>Abo boshi bali bayansire abakazi b’ahandi. Babahulusa n’abâna bâbo.<verse eid="EZR 10:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 10"/>
</usx>
